      reference path) through the kphy registry, running the PMA init +
      LCPLL/CDR lock sequence and clearing the U3 port's GRF disable word.
      Translation of the pinned usbdp-phy reference (USB path only; DP is
      out of scope on this board).

config KFEAT_DRIVER_PHY_COMBPHY
